<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-14T14:22:18.977Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 14:22:18 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iran says it struck a US military radar in Bahrain in retaliation for a strike on southern Iran, while Pakistan’s security forces reported killing 74 terrorists in raids across Khyber Pakhtunkhwa and Balochistan. In North Waziristan two soldiers were killed and 14 terrorists were killed in an operation, and two women died in a hit-and-run on Murree Road. The Taliban-run Afghan government’s new road to China remains unusable because the border is closed. The conflict still accounts for 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/13/iran-us-radar-bahrain-sirik-hormuz&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/13/russia-sends-major-business-delegation-to-kabul-for-business-talks-with-the-taliban&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxONy02TmlRVzBvdm0wQW9IZFJWdWRXN1FxeDZNZjJDNkJBYmVhYkN5TjR0TndxSE1rMzFDUGIyVWNMNmhPOU1acjdaYlRTZ1ROTWt1WHVpV3JUd3hLMnlQSWZhYVc2X1NQa2U2RXYtU3hReV9WYmFodXVIOWo4ZlpKa3RZcTdWZl9OamVCQTVqc2dRSjh3cE81M2FuZURoRUR3MTdpRFZ6SlVaaVJvUTlJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNdWpQX2NaazdWM3JrQjA2N1lGQjVjNVJIUm1HeFYyZ0E5VkNsSVhNUzIyeV9aSkt2U3BMMzY2am9GNGY1VE5JZlNqU09kZlNsdHYtSEZBb2JYNXlVVlpmMWRTUjJEY2tPYjVMZUpMUHM2Mm5DalY4MXkwNXR2Um8xSXRCQkd5TjdFanM0UjdXN01Mb1JBYjNRQUtKR1lzYnU0bXUxQnJkNTdseTFQeFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFByalJUS1lwUlc1MWRPcHZzM1FxaGtvdkhIdlAyaU10OGxBS0VtWDBfV2NBX1RGU3VodmxRR21vY2JPZGRNQ0ozYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFA2eFF0OGs1LU05RkNKNDkwX240S1ItbDQ4T1UzZ1hmdTRvblVHcl9RMEJfUEo0Zm5QZXpWUFlVRXFqeGJNaUtvUg?o